    "turn_text": "so uh... congressman lahood talking about the derm report and one thing you've got to consider is you know the consumers of media and voters out there this all deals with you know the twenty sixteen election and the uh... spurious allegations that were made from a steel dossier that was then laundered through the intelligence community to set up Trump and cast aspersions on the incoming president. And that lasted with corporate media parroting a lot of the allegations from the report from the from the steel dossier. And it all turns out to be fabricated and promulgated by a media that was cooperating with the intelligence community to put this stuff out. You then stack on top just before the 2020 election. The New York Post story about Hunter Biden's laptop being suppressed. So I asked the congressman heading into the 2024 election, how guarded should voters be with all of this here in the in the ether?",
