    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/6/46687.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "So this all happening of course with just the very, very near nature of the 2024 election and when it comes to the Republican field it was reported yesterday that Florida Governor Ron DeSantis is going to be announcing next week or at least filing papers to run for president, and that could come next week. Well, Ron DeSantis has made several visits to Illinois. Most recently, he was in Peoria where Congressman LaHood was there to welcome and present the the Florida governor in front of some Republicans at a Lincoln Day dinner in Peoria. I asked the congressman if that's an endorsement of DeSantis.",
